			<DisplayName>Medium Resource Claim Pylon</DisplayName>
			<Icon>Textures\GUI\Icons\Cubes\KJN_KWP_RES_ResourceClaimPylon_Medium.dds</Icon>
			<Description>A powerful mining pylon with a 150m detection range. Does not consume detected ores but will affect other pylons.

Base Ore Output: 30 units
Mining Range: 250m radius (500m depth)
Ally Interferrence Range: 7km
Enemy Suppression Range: 10km
Interference Penalty: 10%
Suppression Penalty: 20%</Description>
